<title>USA: Tosco sells heating oil distributor.</title>
<headline>Tosco sells heating oil distributor.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tosco Corp said Thursday it has agreed to sell the assets of the Pacific Northwest Energy Co to Southern Counties Oil Co.</p>
<p>Tosco noted it recently acquired the Pacific Northwest, which distributes heating oil in parts of Washington and Oregon, as part of its acquisition of Unocal Corp's West Coast refining and marketing assets.</p>
<p>It said the terms of the sale to Southern Counties Oil were not disclosed, except that it is an all-cash transaction scheduled to close at the end of the current quarter.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
